OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney election poll topped by
OL,4,A21-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old candidate has topped the
OL,7,Fpoll in Alderney's general election.
OL,9,FHeather Syer was among the nine
OL,10,Fcandidates who secured the five
OL,11,Favailable seats and will serve
OL,12,Ffour-year terms until 2030.
OL,14,FJeannie Cameron, Sarah Woodnutt, Steve
OL,15,FRoberts and Ian Taylor secured the
OL,16,Fremaining seats in the States of
OL,17,FAlderney.
OL,19,FThe States said 831 papers were issued,
OL,20,Fsix were spoiled and one postal vote
OL,21,Fwas not returned - there was a 58%
OL,22,Fturnout.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
